1
00:00:09,973 --> 00:00:09,973
[Intro]

2
00:00:09,973 --> 00:00:19,973
Under the Highest's shelter.

3
00:00:29,202 --> 00:00:29,202
[Verse 1]

4
00:00:29,202 --> 00:00:33,910
Whoever makes the Most High his dwelling

5
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:38,856
will rest beneath the God of heaven's care.

6
00:00:38,856 --> 00:00:44,601
I say, Lord, you are my helper;

7
00:00:44,601 --> 00:00:49,947
my refuge and my God, I trust in you.

8
00:00:49,947 --> 00:00:54,096
You draw me from the hunter's hidden net

9
00:00:54,096 --> 00:01:00,718
and bring me through the trouble in my way.

10
00:01:00,718 --> 00:01:00,718
[Verse 2]

11
00:01:00,718 --> 00:01:06,223
Your shoulders cast their shadow over me;

12
00:01:06,223 --> 00:01:11,410
beneath your wings my fear grows still.

13
00:01:11,410 --> 00:01:16,755
Your faithfulness surrounds me like a shield;

14
00:01:16,755 --> 00:01:22,101
your faithful word is guarding me.

15
00:01:22,101 --> 00:01:22,101
[Pre-Chorus]

16
00:01:22,101 --> 00:01:27,527
The dread that comes at night cannot command me;

17
00:01:27,527 --> 00:01:32,872
the flying arrow cannot rule my day.

18
00:01:32,872 --> 00:01:37,500
The darkness carries no power over me,

19
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:43,245
nor does the evil striking at high noon.

20
00:01:43,245 --> 00:01:43,245
[Chorus]

21
00:01:43,245 --> 00:01:46,037
Though a thousand fall beside me

22
00:01:46,037 --> 00:01:48,670
and ten thousand at my right,

23
00:01:48,670 --> 00:01:51,463
your shelter will stand around me;

24
00:01:51,463 --> 00:01:53,936
that harm will never reach me.

25
00:01:53,936 --> 00:02:03,431
Though a thousand fall beside me,

26
00:02:03,431 --> 00:02:11,011
I will trust you through the fight.

27
00:02:11,011 --> 00:02:11,011
[Verse 3]

28
00:02:11,011 --> 00:02:15,878
I may see the wicked face their wages,

29
00:02:15,878 --> 00:02:21,463
but I have called the Highest one my home.

30
00:02:21,463 --> 00:02:23,856
Lord, you are the hope I hold.

31
00:02:23,856 --> 00:02:25,771
No evil can claim my dwelling;

32
00:02:25,771 --> 00:02:31,915
no scourge will settle by my door.

33
00:02:31,915 --> 00:02:31,915
[Pre-Chorus]

34
00:02:31,915 --> 00:02:37,261
The dread that comes at night cannot command me;

35
00:02:37,261 --> 00:02:42,686
the flying arrow cannot rule my day.

36
00:02:42,686 --> 00:02:47,394
The darkness carries no power over me,

37
00:02:47,394 --> 00:02:53,059
nor does the evil striking at high noon.

38
00:02:53,059 --> 00:02:53,059
[Chorus]

39
00:02:53,059 --> 00:02:55,293
Though a thousand fall beside me

40
00:02:55,293 --> 00:02:58,644
and ten thousand at my right,

41
00:02:58,644 --> 00:03:01,436
your shelter will stand around me;

42
00:03:01,436 --> 00:03:03,910
that harm will never reach me.

43
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:06,463
Though a thousand fall beside me,

44
00:03:06,463 --> 00:03:14,122
I will trust you through the fight.

45
00:03:14,122 --> 00:03:14,122
[Bridge]

46
00:03:14,122 --> 00:03:20,027
You send your angels out to watch my steps

47
00:03:20,027 --> 00:03:22,899
and keep me on the road ahead.

48
00:03:22,899 --> 00:03:30,319
They lift me high above the jagged stone.

49
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:33,670
The viper and the basilisk lie beneath my feet;

50
00:03:33,670 --> 00:03:43,670
the lion and the dragon cannot bar the way.

51
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:07,500
[Guitar Solo]

52
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:07,500
[Final Verse]

53
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:13,484
Because you have held on to me, I will rescue you.

54
00:04:13,484 --> 00:04:18,191
You know my name; I will guard your life.

55
00:04:18,191 --> 00:04:20,824
Call, and I will answer.

56
00:04:20,824 --> 00:04:23,457
When trouble comes, I will be there.

57
00:04:23,457 --> 00:04:25,691
I'll bring you through and raise you up.

58
00:04:25,691 --> 00:04:28,883
I'll fill your days and let you see

59
00:04:28,883 --> 00:04:31,915
the saving work of my hand.

60
00:04:31,915 --> 00:04:31,915
[Final Chorus]

61
00:04:31,915 --> 00:04:34,628
Though a thousand fall beside me

62
00:04:34,628 --> 00:04:37,340
and ten thousand at my right,

63
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:40,133
your shelter will stand around me;

64
00:04:40,133 --> 00:04:42,527
that harm will never reach me.

65
00:04:42,527 --> 00:04:45,160
Though a thousand fall beside me,

66
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:52,021
I will trust you through the fight.

67
00:04:52,021 --> 00:04:52,021
[Outro]

68
00:04:52,021 --> 00:04:53,617
Under the Highest's shelter.

69
00:04:53,617 --> 00:04:59,293
[End]

